Thank you Antigoni.

I am indeed considering directly solving Q1 and Q2 through bilat.symmetry. For my specimen of object symmetry but without replication (like the scallops example), bilat.symmetry only provides F-value and p-value for ind and side. The ind:side, which signifies FA, is the relabeled residual term, so there is no statistics for this term. However, I am interested in knowing if FA does exist, so some statistic seems necessary here. I am not sure if there is some workaround.

Patrick.

